  "notes": "USAGE:\nOften used with {喫|きっ}する (to suffer/sustain) in the formal expression {完敗|かんぱい}を{喫|きっ}する. Common in sports reporting and political commentary.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {完敗|かんぱい}を{喫|きっ}する (to suffer a complete defeat)\n- {完敗|かんぱい}に{終|お}わる (to end in total defeat)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {惨敗|ざんぱい}: miserable defeat (emphasizes how devastating it was)\n- {大敗|たいはい}: major defeat (large-scale loss)\n- {完勝|かんしょう}: complete victory (the opposite)",
